mirror at 0.0 deg: (3, 1) -> (3.000, -1.000), det -1.000
mirror at 45.0 deg: (3, 1) -> (1.000, 3.000), det -1.000
mirror at 90.0 deg: (3, 1) -> (-3.000, 1.000), det -1.000
mirror at 30.0 deg: (3, 1) -> (2.366, 2.098), det -1.000
mirror at 30 then 45: rotation by 30.000 deg, (3, 1) -> (2.098, 2.366)
mirror at 45 then 30: rotation by -30.000 deg
same mirror twice: (3, 1) -> (3.000, 1.000)
